{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1339878,\"title\":\"Famous Ghost Stories\",\"tagline\":\"A Terrifying Story of Supernatural Passion!\",\"overview\":\"A TV pilot masterminded by B movie auteur Bert I. Gordon and cable production company Herts-Lion International. Vincent Price hosts as a poltergeist introducing the ghost story to follow. It's really an edited version of Gordon's 1960 film Tormented, starring Richard Carlson as a jazz musician haunted by the spirit of an old flame he let fall from a lighthouse.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c7d8qcX2PILCsHW143nVdk463PO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hDGnfDMdn4Oet6r28iVRSt6Mc6M.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":1961,\"runtime\":75,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Bert I. Gordon\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":101225,\"name\":\"Bert I. Gordon\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z88K5pIIsgziUUeFryxxqTXrHqo.jpg\"},{\"id\":1905,\"name\":\"Vincent Price\",\"character\":\"Poltergeist/Narrator\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7JIv7U5kwveryP7hrPYgHlKea4d.jpg\"},{\"id\":67685,\"name\":\"Richard Carlson\",\"character\":\"Tom Stewart (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dTKsl3WAzvfFBHAgOmwt959oFHi.jpg\"},{\"id\":100606,\"name\":\"Susan Gordon\",\"character\":\"Sandy Hubbard (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bABkShtFmi86fxNsUsi3QaFS5ro.jpg\"},{\"id\":101229,\"name\":\"Lugene Sanders\",\"character\":\"Meg Hubbard (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":101230,\"name\":\"Juli Reding\",\"character\":\"Vi Mason (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sF8CLTM5i0eVQ2xhQuERzYqNcyr.jpg\"},{\"id\":592,\"name\":\"Joe Turkel\",\"character\":\"Nick (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rqpNzjLFCoMrvGSf6SIL5JnWwMT.jpg\"},{\"id\":101231,\"name\":\"Lillian Adams\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Ellis (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":101232,\"name\":\"Gene Roth\",\"character\":\"Mr. Nelson (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mx7J3DIue4s5ShNaxmdq8TNFxPY.jpg\"},{\"id\":153234,\"name\":\"Vera Marshe\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Hubbard (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kleuz1TY6p7mGhOAreFqjbYZEyo.jpg\"},{\"id\":1193325,\"name\":\"Harry Fleer\",\"character\":\"Frank Hubbard (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1045385,\"name\":\"Merritt Stone\",\"character\":\"Clergyman (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2625840,\"name\":\"Dick Walsh\",\"character\":\"Wedding Guest (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2057139,\"name\":\"Leslie Thomas\",\"character\":\"Wedding Guest (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":16417,\"name\":\"Paul Frees\",\"character\":\"Frank Hubbard (uncredited voice) (segment 'Tormented')\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pACT0LYkEyff7PGt88iqr5u9T7u.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":7342,\"title\":\"Carrie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/30wtkJVv6Zjl3joUX7tmrgGJVBZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8z5qtVE2N3AuA3bmvIQsI10Wjg8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl's lonely life is dominated by relentless bullying at school and an oppressive religious fanatic mother at home. When her tormentors pull a humiliating prank at the senior prom, she unleashes a horrifying chaos on everyone, leaving nothing but destruction in her wake.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"TV Movie\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":19543,\"title\":\"Anacondas: Trail of Blood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/916jenbMstGCE20hceYDTo8psf4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zzJxwLTX5QCWkWsq7RnRhNKFBBo.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A genetically created Anaconda, cut in half, regenerates itself into two new aggressive giant snakes, due to the Blood Orchid.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14863,\"title\":\"Anaconda 3: Offspring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3PI6dXS0UlNlB6IXnngfEtufFxm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmB5vs4KqJdo767gncUrS9vAsRz.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mercenary-for-hire accepts a mission from a billionaire to capture a dangerous snake that could possibly help cure a terminal illness.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":571055,\"title\":\"Down\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tWD5FXfXTRcYzXZLq0bg8hxmQrs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o2HR6hDdsIIXEJV7p2KulKybCvo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A pair of coworkers gets trapped in an elevator over a long weekend, but what at first promises to be a romantic connection turns nefarious as each party begins to reveal who they truly are.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":532814,\"title\":\"The Bad Seed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1m10QitDjpbZgFP1syXgVOv2pH7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yt3wwVVZEeE0VvsxooDTwZhY8Ig.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A widower suspects that his seemingly perfect adolescent daughter is a heartless killer.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13204,\"title\":\"Hellboy Animated: Blood and Iron\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/itj3KXrYL6iSa7eBDLYIVWZuZtW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iwAQV8m7jknUflreDmQpSdmmCmf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Hellboy, Liz Sherman, and Abe Sapien are assigned to investigate the ghost-infested mansion of a publicity-hound billionaire, they uncover a plot to resurrect a beautiful yet monstrous vampire from Professor Bruttenholm’s past. But before they can stop her bloodbath, Hellboy will have to battle harpies, hellhounds, a giant werewolf, and even the ferocious goddess Hecate herself.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25754,\"title\":\"Children of the Corn\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y9sFEgoTkjfy8i0CQzLADxFC0Hf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hmmLX3wR20VD0kl9moXfI7EqSad.jpg\",\"rating\":4.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A traveling couple end up in an abandoned Nebraska town inhabited by a cult of murderous children who worship a demon that lives in the local cornfields.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550148,\"title\":\"The Body\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ZJkoWMPGpFqdVplXivjQOYEp4H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/txf54dz60Hvb4nETdXY1glKa0tV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Los Angeles, on Halloween night, a hitman tries to transport a corpse in plain sight, but people he stumbles upon on the street, believing that his sophisticated appearance is a magnificent disguise, constantly stand in his way to congratulate him.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":786300,\"title\":\"Tentacles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rRfcH0jg9X8czKJhXCnny45NSWt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iID0at69rWzZOIarUIFrfDOFJA.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young Los Angeles couple Tara and Sam fall head over heels into a new romance, entwining their lives—until their intimacy transforms into something terrifying.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15021,\"title\":\"The Baby's Room\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t5BtCJyju9ltoVUV0VmwKUt5N0S.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nm5nC0vKRHSZZoQuhdmVuEML5kO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Juan and Sonia arrive at a large old house, an ideal place to raise their newborn son. When, one night before going to bed, they check the operation of the monitoring device installed in the baby's room, they discover that someone is sitting next to the crib.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21800,\"title\":\"The Ungodly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/69l0scoORONAILNDtcG2InPkt4w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When struggling filmmaker inadvertently records a notorious serial killer in the middle of a murderous act, he decides to use the footage to blackmail the madman into being the subject of a disturbing new documentary.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27802,\"title\":\"The Ghosts of Angela Webb\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":3.8,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Angela Webb believes her house is haunted. Psychics Alexander Stewart and Bernadette Fieldstone are contacted to try to uncover the secrets hidden within her home. What they experience is more than a mere haunting. They come to understand that reality is far more horrifying than fiction. What makes this ghost story unique is that it is based on a true story. In 2001 the two psychics investigated an old western New Jersey farmhouse. So powerful were the images they captured on film, a British television production company met with Angela Webb to do a television special at her house! The story IS factual; the conclusion is shocking.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"wyGMXtXVc0s\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nH8vQv7F6mw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nOMXR_CMhs0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}